[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300400_03_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300400_03_0010","text":"嗯，请用～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300400_03_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300400_03_0020","text":"抱歉，让你久等了\n我买了今川烧，要吃吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300400_03_0030","text":"嗯～！\n要吃～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300400_03_0040","text":"有红豆粒馅、卡仕达、奶油奶酪\n还有御好烧风味的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300400_03_0050","text":"选你喜欢的就好"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300400_03_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300400_03_0060","text":"呀哈～♡　谢谢～！\n那雏菜要奶油奶酪的～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300400_03_0070","text":"老板说是刚出炉的，\n小心别烫着了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300400_03_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300400_03_0080","text":"……今川烧，从哪边吃都可以呢～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300400_03_0081","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300400_03_0090","text":"……来，分一半给制作人～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_22300400_03_0100","text":"哈哈，谢了"}]
